				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">"<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Timemus bellum in futuram aestatem gravissimum fore in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> propter <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName>, qui a Caesare sunt proclamati et proscripti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l61">Brema</placeName> urbs <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illis adhęret; reliqui omnes hostes sunt tam principes quam civitates.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName> <placeName ref="l284">Lipsię</placeName> fuit, qui scabie supra modum vexatur, excruciatur <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et exulceratur, cum quo coenavi; qui si posset, in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> non maneret.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Habita sunt comitia <placeName ref="l284">Lipsię</placeName>, quę calendis Ianuarii dissipata sunt post <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>discessum <persName>Mauritii</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Interim Cęsareum equites et civitates noluerunt <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>recipere; docti tamen, inter quos praecipui fuere doctor <persName>Belgeranus</persName>, <persName ref="p2095">Me<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>lanchthon</persName> et <persName ref="p4503">Ioachimus Camerarius</persName>, quaedam propter communem concordiam admiserunt, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>utpote confirmationem, unctionem, ieiunium et dies quosdam profestos sanctorum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Interfuit comitiis <persName ref="p6369">Erasmus Sa[r]cerius</persName>, qui in exilium pulsus propter evangelium <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ac <placeName>Amerbergi</placeName> haeret apud nobilem nomine <persName>Wolfgangum a Linderauw</persName>, et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cum eo 24 concionatores eiecti ex comitatu comitum a <placeName ref="l1229">Nassauw</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Hic omnes concionatores sunt proscripti, et populus iam sine pastores misere agit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Secundus articulus de expeditione facienda contra <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et <placeName ref="l61">Bremenses</placeName>; emporium <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgense</placeName> in <placeName>Marchiam</placeName> est translatum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>atque reliqui census Caesaris mandato omnes illis abrepti sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName>Ioachimus</persName> elector Interim recepit cum aliis principibus <placeName ref="l749">Saxonię</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Missę <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>papisticę in tota <placeName>Marchia</placeName> habentur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Frater marchionis, <persName>Ioannes a Costrin</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>omnino illi repugnat et graviter est iratus, quod relicto verbo dei in Interim <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>papisticum consensum suum dederit; se velle mori cum ministris verbi dixit, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>praecipue cum evangelio Christi Iesu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tertius articulus de reddendo tributo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Cupit Cęsar pro corona Cęsarea <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ab electoribus <persName>Mauritio</persName> et Augusto 8 thonen goldt, quam pecunię summam <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>papę dare vult et papam ab eo petere.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">2. <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> petit V donellos auri <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>propter civitates, in quibus minera invenitur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Item <persName ref="p18250">Mauricius</persName> hat win und <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>bier gesteigt, dorvon er järlich mag innemen 10 donen goldts... in<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>kommen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sic luxus principum debet perdere regna."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Hęc ex <placeName ref="l284">Lipsia</placeName> ad me et <persName ref="p8418">Myconium</persName>, qui graviter <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>decumbit, scripta sunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">1549. 6. <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Februarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Unterschrift fehlt.]</note>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
